        "content": "NWC204_SU26_FE | Multiple Choice Question 37\n\n(Choose 1 answer)\n\nMatch the IPv6 address with the IPv6 address type. (Not all options are used.)\n\n| | |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| A. link-local | 1. 2001:DB8::BAF:3F57:FE94 |\n| B. solicited node multicast | 2. FF02::1 |\n| C. global unicast | 3. ::1 |\n| D. all node multicast | 4. FF02::1:FFAE:F85F |\n| E. loopback | |\n| F. unique local | |",
